DESCRIPTION >
    Wave 3 aggregated attribution. One row per (source, medium, campaign) with
    conversions=count() and revenue=SUM(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value))),
    serving lastTouchNonDirectAttribution (api/lib/attribution-engine.js:221-278, queryName
    'last_touch_non_direct_attribution'). Faithful 1:1 port.
    Same LAST-touch argMax structure as last_touch_by_site_agg.pipe (validated ASOF null-skip),
    with two live-code differences reproduced exactly:
      1. NON-DIRECT gate on the pageview set: WHERE utm_source IS NOT NULL AND utm_source != ''
         AND utm_source != 'direct' (live :249-251). Applied to EVERY field's ASOF subquery so
         all argMax picks are over the same non-direct-utm_source pageview set, then each field
         null-skips its own column (utm_medium gets an extra IS NOT NULL; utm_campaign uses
         nullIf(utm_campaign,'') IS NOT NULL so the skip ENGAGES on Tinybird's empty-string campaign
         — '' here vs NULL in PostHog — crediting the latest REAL campaign like LIVE argMax, not '').
      2. NO ai_source: the live non-direct inner has only 3 argMax fields (utm_source/medium/
         campaign, :235-237) and the outer source = COALESCE(NULLIF(utm_source,''), 'direct')
         with NO ai_source fallback (:226) — unlike last_touch (which has an ai_source field +
         fallback). campaign = raw utm_campaign (no COALESCE, :228), matching live.
    ARGMAX NULL-SKIP reproduced via independent ASOF LEFT JOINs (timestamp <= conv = last
    preceding), the structure validated in last_touch_by_site.pipe. Join key distinct_id (live :253).
    Typed-column translation (§2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type; pageview
    fields from events_by_visitor.
    MONEY: revenue cast toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value)) == live
    toFloatOrZero(toString(e.properties.conversion_value)); conv is 1 row per $conversion, each
    ASOF adds <=1 match -> value counted once, matching the live 1:1 join + SUM.
    SCOPE LIMIT (inherited): validated only for distinct_id == visitor_id; merged-identity UNVERIFIED.
    VALUE-PARITY NOT RUN (rate-limited) — founder must value-gate before enabling. NOT DEPLOYED.

NODE last_touch_non_direct_by_site_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        COALESCE(NULLIF(utm_source, ''), 'direct') AS source,
        COALESCE(NULLIF(utm_medium, ''), 'none') AS medium,
        utm_campaign AS campaign,
        countIf(lower(coalesce(conversion_type, '')) != 'refund') AS conversions,
        SUM(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value))) AS revenue
    FROM
    (
        SELECT
            conv.conversion_value AS conversion_value,
            conv.conversion_type AS conversion_type,
            src.utm_source AS utm_source,
            med.utm_medium AS utm_medium,
            camp.utm_campaign AS utm_campaign
        FROM
        (
            SELECT event_id, distinct_id, timestamp, conversion_value, conversion_type
            FROM events
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$conversion'
              AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from, required=True) }}
              AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to, required=True) }}
        ) AS conv
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, utm_source FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview'
              AND utm_source IS NOT NULL AND utm_source != '' AND utm_source != 'direct'
        ) AS src ON conv.distinct_id = src.distinct_id AND src.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, utm_medium FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview'
              AND utm_source IS NOT NULL AND utm_source != '' AND utm_source != 'direct'
              AND utm_medium IS NOT NULL
        ) AS med ON conv.distinct_id = med.distinct_id AND med.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            -- nullIf(campaign,'') so the null-skip ENGAGES on Tinybird's empty-string campaign
            -- representation (Tinybird stores empty utm_campaign as '', not NULL). LIVE reads PostHog
            -- where empty campaign is NULL, so argMax skips the empty touch and credits a later REAL
            -- campaign; the bare `IS NOT NULL` here would pass '' and diverge. WHERE excludes ''+NULL;
            -- the SELECT nullIf keeps the picked value consistent. Matches live argMax(pv.utm_campaign)
            -- null-skip (attribution-engine.js:249). source/medium unchanged (see first_touch twin).
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, nullIf(utm_campaign, '') AS utm_campaign FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview'
              AND utm_source IS NOT NULL AND utm_source != '' AND utm_source != 'direct'
              AND nullIf(utm_campaign, '') IS NOT NULL
        ) AS camp ON conv.distinct_id = camp.distinct_id AND camp.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
    )
    GROUP BY source, medium, campaign
    ORDER BY revenue DESC
    LIMIT 50000

TYPE endpoint
